# The oldest launcher version that may still go online (docs/UPDATES.md, "Retiring a version").
#
# Empty, as it is now: every version may. To retire versions, put one plain version on the next
# line (for example 0.3.0), after that release is out, and merge it. Releases and the weekly
# renewal copy it into the signed latest.json as min_supported_version; a launcher below it then
# shows "Update required" and keeps only offline play. A version above the latest release stops
# the release and the renewal, on purpose.
